    "description": "The Payment History Retrieval API allows users to access the transaction history of payments made through the platform. This endpoint provides essential data on past transactions, enabling consumers to review details such as amounts, dates, and transaction statuses. It serves businesses, financial institutions, and end-users seeking to track their payment activities for accounting and reconciliation purposes. By utilizing this API, developers can integrate payment history functionalities into their applications, offering users a seamless way to manage their financial records.",
